return ['x-generator'=>'GlotPress/4.0.1','translation-revision-date'=>'2022-08-27 15:16:52+0000','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;','project-id-version'=>'Plugins - NS Cloner &#8211; Site Copier - Stable (latest release)','language'=>'es','messages'=>['NS Cloner Statistics'=>'Estadísticas de NS Cloner','We\'d be grateful if you are willing to allow the NS Cloner to share cloning statistics with us to help improve the plugin and offer better support. 
            It won\'t include any actual data from your site except the raw domain name at most. 
            But you have full control over this and can update it at any time from the Cloner Logs/Status page.'=>'Te estaremos agradecidos si permites a NS Cloner compartir las estadísticas de clonación con nosotros para ayudar a mejorar el plugin y ofrecer un mejor soporte. 
